# One allowed FQDN per line, matched by tinyproxy's `FilterType fqdn` (substring
# match against the request host). Everything else is refused
# (`FilterDefaultDeny Yes` in tinyproxy.conf). Keep this list to exactly two
# kinds of destination (final draft §12.2 M8): the LLM gateway, and a package
# mirror for dependency installs. Add your real hostnames before deploying.

# The LLM gateway (LiteLLM proxy). Replace with its real internal hostname.
litellm.internal

# Package mirrors used by sandboxed builds and tests. Trim this to whatever
# your products actually need — every extra entry widens the blast radius of
# a compromised sandbox.
pypi.org
files.pythonhosted.org
registry.npmjs.org
